# Vite / PWA build artefacts
dev-dist

# Agent-harness mirrors of files this repo already tracks.
#
# Some harnesses generate their own copy of the project instructions and
# skills next to ours: AGENTS.md is CLAUDE.md, and .agents/skills mirrors
# .claude/skills. Both are committed here under their real names, so the
# copies add nothing — and they are generated with their internal
# pointers rewritten (AGENTS.md sends you to a .Codex/skills that does
# not exist), so tracking them would put two subtly disagreeing versions
# of one instruction file in the repository.
#
# .claude/ itself stays tracked on purpose. launch.json is how the app is
# started and the ship skill is the deploy procedure; both are project
# content that anybody working here needs.
AGENTS.md
.agents/

# Emulator run logs.
firestore-debug.log
firebase-debug.log
